            "notes": "## If the enemy team has 2  or more of these heroes:  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49)  [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54)  [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424)  [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05)  [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0)  [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9)  [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) \n\nthen buy:  [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) instead of  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) \n\n## How to play this build:\n\n- 1: don't die. so stay back, **use your shield bash for running away** rather than running in. and you really don't have to swing, this is mostly a Whipshot build.\n\n- 2: ABP. Always Be Poking. Use your Whipshot any and every chance you get.\n\n- 3: Have fun.\n![images](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/416427452085305376/1154435277289435266/3dgifmaker06360.gif?ex=68afc962&is=68ae77e2&hm=e259f70918aad9fd7f96943efaaf5a8d93c891bfacb3999828b2fcfe09b4eb73&)",
