            "notes": "## Prioritize: \n\n [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) \n\n\n\n## Extra money:\n [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) if they have poke.\notherwise:\n [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) for more damage\nor  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for more survivability against close burst damage.\n\n\n## How to play this round:\n\nThis build has a lot of Ability power from  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)  so you can get AS MUCH CASH AS YOU CAN.\n\nSo i want you to stay back, NOT die, whipshot as much as possible, and always use packs.\n\nAnd please don't use your shield bash aggressively. you can play aggressively but just save your shield bash to run.\n\n\n## TLDR: get money and dont die :V\n\n- you can sell  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) if you dont have the money.\n\n![images](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/416427452085305376/1154435277289435266/3dgifmaker06360.gif?ex=68afc962&is=68ae77e2&hm=e259f70918aad9fd7f96943efaaf5a8d93c891bfacb3999828b2fcfe09b4eb73&)",
