            "notes": "## Prioritize: \n [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) or  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) for the enemy tank.\n\n## Extra money:\nsell  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and get  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) \n\n## How to play: \nIf  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) :\nwith this, focus on healing mostly, and whipping the squishies in their backline **SAFELY!!!** \nthe biggest mistakes i see brig players make is playing so aggressively, for reference, from now on, play brig as if you would play ana!!!!\n\nIf  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) :\nFocus their tank with your whips. whipping them every 4 seconds just renders any tank useless. (unless its that yucky cow)\n\n\n- TLDR:  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) = heal and whip squishies/low hp enemies.\n [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) = whip the tank 24/7\n![images](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/416427452085305376/1154435277289435266/3dgifmaker06360.gif?ex=68afc962&is=68ae77e2&hm=e259f70918aad9fd7f96943efaaf5a8d93c891bfacb3999828b2fcfe09b4eb73&)",
